{"data": {"weaknessId": "w-767", "occurrenceProperties": [{"key": "description", "value": "Multer is vulnerable to denial-of-service (DoS) due to improper handling of file uploads with empty string field names. This could allow an attacker to crash the server by sending a specially crafted upload request that triggers an unhandled exception.

